31.699" end="00:36.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:31.699" end="00:31.907">你</span><span begin="00:31.907" end="00:32.150">總</span><span begin="00:32.150" end="00:32.616">偽裝</span><span begin="00:32.616" end="00:32.869">自</span><span begin="00:32.869" end="00:33.221">己</span><span begin="00:33.669" end="00:33.886">不</span><span begin="00:33.886" end="00:34.172">痛</span> <span begin="00:34.615" end="00:35.030">你總</span><span begin="00:35.030" end="00:35.421">笑</span><span begin="00:35.506" end="00:35.715">著</span><span begin="00:35.715" end="00:36.292">逞</span><span begin="00:36.292" end="00:36.851">強</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你总伪装自己不痛 你总笑着逞强</span></p><p begin="00:37.986" end="00:45.111" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:37.986" end="00:38.426">對於</span><span begin="00:38.426" end="00:38.684">愛</span><span begin="00:38.684" end="00:39.447">情</span><span begin="00:39.447" end="00:39.745">害</span><span begin="00:39.745" end="00:40.113">怕</span><span begin="00:40.329" end="00:40.625">觸</span><span begin="00:40.625" end="00:41.593">碰</span> <span begin="00:42.662" end="00:43.148">放</span><span begin="00:43.148" end="00:43.727">棄</span><span begin="00:43.727" end="00:44.281">掙</span><span begin="00:44.281" end="00:45.111">扎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对于爱情害怕触碰 放弃挣扎</span></p><p begin="00:46.465" end="00:50.488" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:46.465" end="00:46.734">你</span><span begin="00:46.734" end="00:47.158">看</span><span begin="00:47.158" end="00:47.456">著</span><span begin="00:47.456" end="00:48.150">我</span><span begin="00:48.150" end="00:48.380">眼</span><span begin="00:48.380" end="00:49.453">睛</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:48.695" end="00:50.488"><span begin="00:48.695" end="00:49.181">(看</span><span begin="00:49.181" end="00:49.422">著</span><span begin="00:49.422" end="00:50.105">我</span><span begin="00:50.105" end="00:50.488">眼睛)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看着我眼睛 (看着我眼睛)</span></p><p begin="00:50.268" end="00:54.282" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:50.268" end="00:50.520">你</span><span begin="00:50.520" end="00:50.971">記</span><span begin="00:50.971" end="00:51.260">著</span><span begin="00:51.260" end="00:51.897">我</span><span begin="00:51.897" end="00:52.308">聲</span><span begin="00:52.308" end="00:53.677">音</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:52.641" end="00:54.282"><span begin="00:52.641" end="00:53.049">(記</span><span begin="00:53.049" end="00:53.245">著</span><span begin="00:53.245" end="00:53.871">我</span><span begin="00:53.871" end="00:54.123">聲</span><span begin="00:54.123" end="00:54.282">音)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你记着我声音 (记着我声音)</span></p><p begin="00:54.194" end="00:55.598" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:54.194" end="00:54.443">無</span><span begin="00:54.443" end="00:54.824">畏</span><span begin="00:54.824" end="00:55.111">風</span><span begin="00:55.111" end="00:55.598">雨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无畏风雨</span></p><p begin="00:56.114" end="01:04.152" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:56.114" end="00:56.346">別</span><span begin="00:56.346" end="00:56.789">忘</span><span begin="00:56.789" end="00:57.161">記</span><span begin="00:57.161" end="00:57.630">還</span><span begin="00:57.630" end="00:57.851">有</span><span begin="00:57.851" end="00:58.249">我</span><span begin="00:58.249" end="00:58.578">站</span><span begin="00:58.578" end="00:59.330">在</span> <span begin="01:01.112" end="01:01.923">這</span><span begin="01:01.923" end="01:04.152">裡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别忘记还有我站在 这里</span></p><p begin="01:04.863" end="01:09.005" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:04.863" end="01:05.788">我只想做</span><span begin="01:05.788" end="01:06.072">你</span><span begin="01:06.072" end="01:06.512">的</span><span begin="01:06.512" end="0