gent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:20.723" end="01:21.032">想</span><span begin="01:21.032" end="01:21.292">做</span><span begin="01:21.292" end="01:21.493">你</span><span begin="01:21.493" end="01:22.032">的</span><span begin="01:22.032" end="01:22.266">太</span><span begin="01:22.266" end="01:22.978">陽</span> <span begin="01:22.978" end="01:23.266">你</span><span begin="01:23.266" end="01:23.916">的</span><span begin="01:23.916" end="01:24.180">太</span><span begin="01:24.180" end="01:24.552">陽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想做你的太阳 你的太阳</span></p><p begin="01:24.703" end="01:28.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:24.703" end="01:24.975">在</span><span begin="01:24.975" end="01:25.284">你的</span><span begin="01:25.284" end="01:25.622">心</span><span begin="01:25.622" end="01:26.131">裡</span><span begin="01:26.131" end="01:26.395">呀</span> <span begin="01:26.614" end="01:26.858">在</span><span begin="01:26.858" end="01:27.212">你的</span><span begin="01:27.212" end="01:27.684">心</span><span begin="01:27.684" end="01:28.052">底</span><span begin="01:28.052" end="01:28.452">呀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你的心里呀 在你的心底呀</span></p><p begin="01:28.537" end="01:31.938" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:28.537" end="01:28.702">就</span><span begin="01:28.702" end="01:29.063">算</span><span begin="01:29.063" end="01:29.319">不</span><span begin="01:29.319" end="01:29.812">能</span><span begin="01:29.812" end="01:30.057">在</span><span begin="01:30.057" end="01:30.422">你</span><span begin="01:30.422" end="01:30.954">身</span><span begin="01:30.954" end="01:31.938">旁</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算不能在你身旁</span></p><p begin="01:32.425" end="01:38.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:32.425" end="01:32.881">也要</span><span begin="01:32.881" end="01:33.124">奮</span><span begin="01:33.124" end="01:33.676">力</span><span begin="01:33.676" end="01:33.907">為</span><span begin="01:33.907" end="01:34.830">你</span><span begin="01:34.830" end="01:36.214">而</span> <span begin="01:36.475" end="01:36.871">發</span><span begin="01:36.871" end="01:38.860">光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也要奋力为你而 发光</span></p><p begin="01:45.256" end="01:50.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:45.256" end="01:46.155">你總感到</span><span begin="01:46.155" end="01:46.411">落</span><span begin="01:46.411" end="01:46.846">寞</span><span begin="01:47.120" end="01:47.377">沮</span><span begin="01:47.377" end="01:47.831">喪</span> <span begin="01:48.200" end="01:48.597">你總</span><span begin="01:48.597" end="01:49.103">感</span><span begin="01:49.103" end="01:49.272">到</span><span begin="01:49.272" end="01:49.807">失</span><span begin="01:49.807" end="01:50.630">望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你总感到落寞沮丧 你总感到失望</span></p><p begin="01:51.523" end="01:59.323" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:51.523" end="01:51.803">對</span><span begin="01:51.803" end="01:52.046">於</span><span begin="01:52.046" end="01:52.204">人</span><span begin="01:52.204" end="01:52.990">生</span><span begin="01:52.990" end="01:53.564">未來</span><span begin="01:53.869" end="01:54.277">總</span><span begin="01:54.277" end="01:54.717">有</span><span begin="01:54.717" end="01:55.127">太</span><span begin="01:55.127" end="01:55.584">多</span><span begin="01:56.342" end="01:58.130">迷</span><span begin="01:58.130" end="01:59.323">惘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对于人生未来总有太多迷惘</span></p><p begin="02:00.773" end="02:06.341" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:00.773" end="02:00.981">你</span><span begin="02:00.981" end="02:01.224">總</span><span begin="02:01.224" end="02:01.690">偽裝</span><span begin="02:01.690" end="02:01.943">自</span><span begin="02:01.943" end="02:02.295">己</span><span begin="02:02.743" end="02:02.960">不</span><span begin="02:02.960" end="02:03.281">痛</span> <span begin="02:03.604" end="02:04.037